WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.440
Ey. ¿Qué?

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.440
What are you doing?

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.320
A year without a woman

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.240
turned you into a jerk?

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:23.880
Or are you just too weak?

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:25.560
You need to pull yourself together.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.760
We have a serious conversation to discuss.

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:31.240
Stop! What conversation?

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:33.320
We haven’t talked in a year.

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:37.360
There are some documents

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:38.520
you need to sign.

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:41.520
Preferably sober.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:45.160
So your lawyers don't rescind it,

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:46.680
because you were drunk.

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:49.880
What documents are you talking about?
